                    <h1 class="font-bold lg:text-md"> Call for Papers: LAND, SMART CITIES, AND SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT </h1>
                    <div class="mt-6">
                        <div>
                            <p> The 4th edition of the CITA 2026 International Conference will focus on crucial issues related to land management, smart urbanization, and sustainable development trajectories. In a global context marked by demographic pressure, resource scarcity, and ecological transition, the relationship between land, smart cities, and sustainability appears to be a major field of research and innovation. The conference will bring together experts, decision-makers, and practitioners from around the world to discuss these issues and identify solutions for the future. </p>
                            <p> CITA 2026 will bring together researchers, practitioners, policy makers, businesses, and civil society actors to explore interdisciplinary approaches and innovative technological solutions for inclusive land governance and resilient cities. </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center w-full"><a href="2026/call" class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#008E3E] px-8 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#008E3E] hover:text-white bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]"> Learn more . . . </a></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
