                    <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" class="font-museo text-gray-500 text-2xm max-w-4xl leading-relaxed mx-auto md:mx-0 aos-init aos-animate"> The conference encourages the submission of research papers, <br class="hidden md:block"> case studies, and feedback. </p>
                </div>
                <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mx-4 md:gap-8 aos-init aos-animate">
