                        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 px-2 leading-tight"> Smart Cities and Emerging Technologies for Urban Governance </h3>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"> This track is dedicated to the application of digital technologies for the optimization of services,infrastructure, and city management. </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-[#F5F5F5] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center w-full max-w-sm h-auto min-h-[300px]">
                        <div class="text-primary mb-6 h-16 flex items-center"><img src="images/img2026/securisation.png" alt="Icon" class="max-h-full"></div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 px-2 leading-tight"> Securing the Land Management Sector, Transparency, and Inclusion </h3>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"> This area focuses on the challenges of digitizing land management and the issues of security, equity, and access. </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-[#F5F5F5] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center w-full max-w-sm h-auto min-h-[300px]">
                        <div class="text-primary mb-6 h-16 flex items-center"><img src="images/img2026/resilience.png" alt="Icon" class="max-h-full"></div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 px-2 leading-tight"> Urban Resilience and Climate Change </h3>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"> This focus area explores the integration of ecological and climate imperatives into land and development policies for sustainable cities. </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-[#F5F5F5] rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center w-full max-w-sm h-auto min-h-[300px]">
                        <div class="text-primary mb-6 h-16 flex items-center"><img src="images/img2026/Frame.png" alt="Icon" class="max-h-full"></div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 px-2 leading-tight"> Fundamental Research and Technological Advances in Digital Technology </h3>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"> This area is open to original and technical contributions in all sub-fields of Information and Communication Technologies. </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col text-[11px] lg:col-span-2 justify-center space-y-4 px-4 py-6 w-full font-museo">
                        <div class="space-y-2">
                            <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Type of contributions :</strong> Research articles, case studies, field notes, demonstrations of technological solutions, posters. </p>
                            <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Languages:</strong> French and English.logical solutions, posters. </p>
                            <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Procedure:</strong> Submissions are anonymized for double-blind evaluation. </p>
                            <p class="ml-4 text-gray-700"><strong>PAPER FORMATS: <br></strong>
                                <li class="">Short articles (5 pages)</li>
                                <li class=""> Long articles (5 to 15 pages) </li>
                            </p>
                        </div>
